    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s02-p124-03870-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Kahneman graduated from Hebrew University and served in the Israeli army as a platoon leader for one year, then as an officer in the psychology branch of the Israel Defense Forces for another year before starting his graduate work at UC Berkeley.",
      "sentenceSha256": "31d3504f0202ba257852f5b4cd273370350615621562351a1f798ce62f11a31c",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s02-p124-03870-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "a1345863054adcbb629fc967202579ef9f57889a4c157876c063a2c301abe1c5",
      "passageSha256": "dac4c6204cddb6012809f787d2d52aad581b1f7f16dcb36233dae00b365bee00",
      "pdfPages": [
        124
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s02-p124-03870-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Before he started his famous collaboration with Amos Tversky on cognitive biases, Kahneman studied psychoanalysis, memory, vision, and motivation.",
      "sentenceSha256": "aeb56d836cde5a064d801e369ca307e9c627bd49f6e1edbb403c125003b9f4be",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s02-p124-03870-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "a1345863054adcbb629fc967202579ef9f57889a4c157876c063a2c301abe1c5",
      "passageSha256": "dac4c6204cddb6012809f787d2d52aad581b1f7f16dcb36233dae00b365bee00",
      "pdfPages": [
        124
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s02-p125-00750-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Kahneman didn’t characterize his life as meaningful.",
      "sentenceSha256": "fcf8cb2783f9d6a564b39042d16d578689ace1de545f76f36549037ff83fc68a",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s02-p125-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "90f0d0adae46fd7a2fa99ce8bbd24c09ab43ba0c688321a73483ef9161c2ef0e",
      "passageSha256": "93ec4bc5102a553e4236799087e83d36512fed6825224532f71c4c35c2bab773",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s02-p125-00750-s004",
      "sentenceText": "In a 2018 interview, he said, “I recall a conversation with Martin Seligman, the founder of positive psychology, in which he tried to convince me I had a meaningful life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "74d089ca3a77d6e6c7996417a5b19c54d6a0ccfb057e714f3ca2ef79d33f3d44",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s02-p125-00750-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "90f0d0adae46fd7a2fa99ce8bbd24c09ab43ba0c688321a73483ef9161c2ef0e",
      "passageSha256": "93ec4bc5102a553e4236799087e83d36512fed6825224532f71c4c35c2bab773",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s02-p125-00750-s006",
      "sentenceText": "‘Meaningful’ isn’t something I understand.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "cc8bbafbe4ec0532c02727f57c46e47c4cc13e62e2b5874f76be048ee5ff251a",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s02-p125-00750-r005-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "a77c79c9fa89e5502be389ac4725dd52ea95e6e2822638e90d5d7d72b92fc2bc",
      "passageSha256": "5fe5ad6f9dd7e7dd3d341283c1231e878ea983f704e2fcd5e8fce0e59a9020e1",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s02-p125-02115-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Neither did Kahneman view his life as wholly happy.",
      "sentenceSha256": "bd3fbb5a756774d17883939c27a62e93a1e4fa9063fc9e7205c4d9619c02849c",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s02-p125-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "e4a7439cff4515a073a5ae91f1422657f21c5ebb34d55d8ba988f61d49368e94",
      "passageSha256": "801e1eac7874784a064011ea35ede4443cdf5a1ef6e5733dba45aafaadeca891",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s02-p125-02115-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Kahneman—who escaped Nazi-occupied Paris, was on the run for three or four years during World War II, and would later go on to win the Nobel Prize—experienced many ups and downs in his life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f1c36ae4f6036ae0e2efb279f6159018113c85354a077a044172934cc1f838cc",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s02-p125-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "e4a7439cff4515a073a5ae91f1422657f21c5ebb34d55d8ba988f61d49368e94",
      "passageSha256": "801e1eac7874784a064011ea35ede4443cdf5a1ef6e5733dba45aafaadeca891",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-s001",
      "sentenceText": "On October 29, 2012, Hurricane Sandy hit New York City.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4f090f78f6c73415bcf5c845eddbc5bc0cb657f2eb5eeceddada7d137b8ff886",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "90dee2474dae3c055f64ae195e6564fe1094109b8bc90b34ef2d5e0ee1110ec1",
      "passageSha256": "503853c6becf09744b73d64fa9e8b74a49b438ba506509e262e2e85674d59140",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Takashi Fujimoto, age sixty-four, was living alone in a basement apartment in Staten Island.",
      "sentenceSha256": "175c8219d8dfde2cfc5f8db30cdf3d96da3d5d89894a1f384d2190d8640b5555",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "90dee2474dae3c055f64ae195e6564fe1094109b8bc90b34ef2d5e0ee1110ec1",
      "passageSha256": "503853c6becf09744b73d64fa9e8b74a49b438ba506509e262e2e85674d59140",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Water began to gush into his apartment while he was working with photographic lighting equipment.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d4f332222e1d7f1f8d694977883fac378f01972b5f9f6c5195f73abe1945a536",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "90dee2474dae3c055f64ae195e6564fe1094109b8bc90b34ef2d5e0ee1110ec1",
      "passageSha256": "503853c6becf09744b73d64fa9e8b74a49b438ba506509e262e2e85674d59140",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-s005",
      "sentenceText": "He spent all night floating in and out of consciousness in his flooded apartment.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4e250308b05a147fad72b28b9f85391d7badc0acd09d97d8b167ca0db143e069",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "3cdc3a5812dee03d9b3f34d15b68ad800abe51f20440eba0ed4c366060fd658a",
      "passageSha256": "27e8fdf3b1c010e3519a4174fab503edd75465f324a62c9aa0199d3e5be11f45",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-s008",
      "sentenceText": "Most of his possessions were ruined.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9d8997b62fd01617811511567f2a1734cbdfbb4930ecbac549eba522d924d6a6",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "3cdc3a5812dee03d9b3f34d15b68ad800abe51f20440eba0ed4c366060fd658a",
      "passageSha256": "27e8fdf3b1c010e3519a4174fab503edd75465f324a62c9aa0199d3e5be11f45",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0045",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-s010",
      "sentenceText": "As recounted in The New York Times, “Mr. Fujimoto became misty-eyed as he talked about the people who helped him recover after the storm.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b911146a8a2c6f33b70252fba9e93c0b058efb49a497fbe1691afdf2cb202455",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-024",
      "parentFingerprint": "90c5925908214e64c763b7b584f760f3b97c62b937bdc8ba704047b420749c7f",
      "passageSha256": "f93d5d66eaaa69dcf104a99c66a344a662b088abe53d387dd78a6b630e429108",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0046",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-s011",
      "sentenceText": "‘It changed my perspective for life.’",
      "sentenceSha256": "ad1db0cb27ad876874f379ea4b84b17bb6fc5e40278b011ba8bcf450b50270fd",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-024",
      "parentFingerprint": "90c5925908214e64c763b7b584f760f3b97c62b937bdc8ba704047b420749c7f",
      "passageSha256": "f93d5d66eaaa69dcf104a99c66a344a662b088abe53d387dd78a6b630e429108",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0047",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-s012",
      "sentenceText": "”",
      "sentenceSha256": "4b6b1bf3818d4e6c9c4358f2232f37dda97af9f651937ebc08864b2739fe29d9",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-03990-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-024",
      "parentFingerprint": "90c5925908214e64c763b7b584f760f3b97c62b937bdc8ba704047b420749c7f",
      "passageSha256": "f93d5d66eaaa69dcf104a99c66a344a662b088abe53d387dd78a6b630e429108",
      "pdfPages": [
        125
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0048",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-06330-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Fujimoto’s experience with Hurricane Sandy was far from intentional.",
      "sentenceSha256": "fa11303bf0588283e05ab9b5e3ce693749b53e8f664ce70bb443e899ea4c4785",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-06330-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "375de2d18c654f157e0d8582ed11efcf4264b4cd157a6ea36785de21f2cd32a5",
      "passageSha256": "64e5c2e6e2eaedc46aa77c166f288bfa15e9145f92ee6bf70f5b0b02b521016f",
      "pdfPages": [
        125,
        126
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0049",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p125-06330-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Though he was proud to have lived independently for the previous thirty-six years, this near-death experience changed him.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a46dbbfb2341a6b8bc871321401a33a9f42aaab084001bfb24e9c5b065ebd492",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p125-06330-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "375de2d18c654f157e0d8582ed11efcf4264b4cd157a6ea36785de21f2cd32a5",
      "passageSha256": "64e5c2e6e2eaedc46aa77c166f288bfa15e9145f92ee6bf70f5b0b02b521016f",
      "pdfPages": [
        125,
        126
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0050",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-s001",
      "sentenceText": "While New York City recovered from Hurricane Sandy fairly quickly, New Orleans suffered for years after Hurricane Katrina.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2a5d2fd4ee208d89431ea5a2df9110999a767510dd5b0007e46462c771b3a7f8",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "7e278d00522e938195580ff2b812e1cd2643ae7acf76376a442707a9a060de2c",
      "passageSha256": "50362eff39a24e77e7e3441a99a8e1cdf26056e03c09672517e1056af428cb9e",
      "pdfPages": [
        126
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0051",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In 2018, Joe Bridges and his son Jordan reflected on the effects of Katrina thirteen years after it happened.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f7ffc0f81a45c6e37c8dbe86549002768248d19d646439ac0dbeb6982666b3a8",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "7e278d00522e938195580ff2b812e1cd2643ae7acf76376a442707a9a060de2c",
      "passageSha256": "50362eff39a24e77e7e3441a99a8e1cdf26056e03c09672517e1056af428cb9e",
      "pdfPages": [
        126
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0052",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Joe said, “It kind of threw me off a little bit because we were living in D.C., where everything is beautiful.",
      "sentenceSha256": "065b4bc01399f94131514614f75809683b3ff8cdf8390e830a1703d767ae503c",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "7e278d00522e938195580ff2b812e1cd2643ae7acf76376a442707a9a060de2c",
      "passageSha256": "50362eff39a24e77e7e3441a99a8e1cdf26056e03c09672517e1056af428cb9e",
      "pdfPages": [
        126
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0053",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-s005",
      "sentenceText": "It’s nice.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c8f4d0c817d1ed9c92abdc382c8da7080da0b60642127304c7bf08a5e16435be",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "a9e2e660b51a58fe8f50ee88ba98960383d501183cd2864855d36e7577e1d50f",
      "passageSha256": "1a4ce990369055b07f233c000523d42eff7a7bd6006f43136937839b7634785f",
      "pdfPages": [
        126
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0054",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-s006",
      "sentenceText": "And then I would come back to New Orleans to where it was like a bomb had went off.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "6b34eddbe65003c5ca04051a3a10920891e4ddba6b3ba5c48ba6bd205338afea",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "a9e2e660b51a58fe8f50ee88ba98960383d501183cd2864855d36e7577e1d50f",
      "passageSha256": "1a4ce990369055b07f233c000523d42eff7a7bd6006f43136937839b7634785f",
      "pdfPages": [
        126
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0055",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-s007",
      "sentenceText": "In 2018, Jordan could still see abandoned homes from Katrina, describing the storm as a “veil” that still covered the city.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8546f9bc75a552254671ae9632bbb366f5dfb22ef9cf5892659118e761bb37ca",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c11-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "a9e2e660b51a58fe8f50ee88ba98960383d501183cd2864855d36e7577e1d50f",
      "passageSha256": "1a4ce990369055b07f233c000523d42eff7a7bd6006f43136937839b7634785f",
      "pdfPages": [
        126
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c11-0056",
      "sentenceId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-s009",
      "sentenceText": "Much stronger, closer knit.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4237bea4f072b7ef8fbc16970e75eee7f6f53576d43ce2661b5b5c46b52caa69",
      "readingUnitId": "c11-s03-p126-01140-r009-012",
